a</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Olshan</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><name><surname>Langlois</surname><given-names>PH</given-names></name><name><surname>Savitz</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Relation between ambient air quality and selected birth defects, seven county study, Texas, 1997&#x02013;2000.</article-title><source>Am J Epidemiol</source><volume>162</volume><fpage>238</fpage><lpage>252</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15987727</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005408-Hwang1"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hwang</surname><given-names>BF</given-names></name><name><surname>Jaakkola</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Ozone and other air pollutants and the risk of oral clefts.</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>116</volume><fpage>1411</fpage><lpage>1415</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18941587</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005408-Strickland1"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Strickland</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Correa</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Reller</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Mahle</surname><given-names>WT</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2009</year><article-title>Ambient Air Pollution and Cardiovascular Malformations in Atlanta, Georgia, 1986&#x02013;2003.</article-title><source>Am J Epidemiol</source><comment>In press</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005408-Barnett1"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barnett</surname><given-names>AG</given-names